  "historyNote": "#5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; amd by #6384-B, eff 11-26-96; amd by #7207-B, eff 2-26-00; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12346, eff 8-14-17; amd by #12922, eff 11-23-19; ss by #14279, eff 8-1-25; ss by #14524, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
